    },
    "Like Signal, iMessage is end-to-end encrypted between devices. The gap most people miss is the backup: unless you have Advanced Data Protection switched on, which limits some functionality, iCloud holds a key to your conversations. Here there is no server-side copy to hold a key to, and no option lets the %@ Dev read anything you have. The %@ Dev has nothing." : {
