        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Like Signal, iMessage is end-to-end encrypted between devices. The gap most people miss is the backup: unless you have Advanced Data Protection switched on, which limits some functionality, iCloud holds a key to your conversations. Here there is no server-side copy to hold a key to, and no option lets the %1$@ Dev read anything you have. The %2$@ Dev has nothing."
          }
        }
