    "Signal" : {

    },
    "Signal's encryption set the standard the rest of the industry strives for, %@ included. However, Signal knows your phone number and runs the servers your messages pass through. %@ has no number and no account, and your history lives on your friends' devices rather than being fetched from a service. We don't know anything about you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Signal's encryption set the standard the rest of the industry strives for, %1$@ included. However, Signal knows your phone number and runs the servers your messages pass through. %2$@ has no number and no account, and your history lives on your friends' devices rather than being fetched from a service. We don't know anything about you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Silence" : {

    },
    "Silenced" : {

    },
    "Since then, %@ added ^[%lld device](inflect: true), most recently on %@. A new device can read what they can." : {
